.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		Quantum ESPRESSO, PBE-D3(BJ), plane waves (60 Ry), 4x4x3 k-points, atoms relaxed in the fixed cell. This calculation shows a molecular crystal of benzene held together by dispersion forces alone, with the flat rings packed edge to face in a herringbone pattern. Structure: benzene I (Pbca, 150 K, X-ray), COD 7238223 (CrystEngComm 2010).
